   "upstream": "Group tzlocal with platformdirs in Dependabot for one run\n\nDependabot still ignores tzlocal because of a 2022 `@dependabot ignore` comment on #1582. The pip job log lists `> 2.1 - from @dependabot ignore command`. The unignore command only works on grouped PRs, so this group makes Dependabot open one. Comment `@dependabot unignore tzlocal` on that PR, then revert this commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
